        <p class="section-lead">You don't need a formal diagnosis or a breaking point to start. These are the themes that bring people in most often.</p>
        <div class="light-cards-3">
          <div class="light-card reveal">
            <small>Hypervigilance</small>
            <h3>Always Scanning</h3>
            <p>Sitting with your back to the wall, bracing for the next call even off duty. We work on bringing your system down out of constant high alert.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="light-card reveal">
            <small>Sleep &amp; Shift Work</small>
